WEBVTT

00:01:01.212 --> 00:01:03.213
And here is the gray one.

00:01:04.712 --> 00:01:07.976
(Laughter)

00:01:08.000 --> 00:01:10.799
So for all of you who saw that,
you're complete realists.

00:01:11.268 --> 00:01:12.441
All right?

00:01:12.465 --> 00:01:13.976
(Laughter)

00:01:14.000 --> 00:01:15.771
So this is pretty amazing, isn't it?

00:01:15.795 --> 00:01:17.597
Because nearly every living system

00:01:17.621 --> 00:01:21.529
has evolved the ability
to detect light in one way or another.

00:01:21.553 --> 00:01:23.394
So for us, seeing color

00:01:23.418 --> 00:01:25.728
is one of the simplest things
the brain does.

00:01:25.752 --> 00:01:28.553
And yet, even at this
most fundamental level,

00:01:28.577 --> 00:01:31.196
context is everything.